{"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)"},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols","doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/GraphProtocols\/Graph"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spectralLayout","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"weight","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": (","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Edges-swift.associatedtype","text":"Edges","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"text":"Index","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Double","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" = { _ in 1 }, ","kind":"text"},{"text":"maxIterations","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"? = nil) ","kind":"text"},{"text":"throws","kind":"keyword"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/NoConvergence","text":"NoConvergence","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphDrawing\/documentation\/GraphDrawing\/Drawing","text":"Drawing","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"Self","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":".","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","text":"Vertex","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A is the weighted adjacency matrix: parallel edges add their weights, self-loops are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"ignored, and a weight of 0 is no edge. The eigenvalues are sorted ascending with their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"multiplicity, so a graph with c components has c zero eigenvalues and its axes come from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"eigenvectors of 0 when c > 1 (which ones is fixed by the solver, not specified). Each axis’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sign makes its first entry, in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"vertices"},{"type":"text","text":" order, whose magnitude is at least 10⁻⁴ of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"largest positive. Two vertices have y = 0, and one vertex is at the origin. The drawing is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"not rescaled ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"rescaled(scale:center:)"},{"type":"text","text":" maps it to a common frame). A directed graph is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"drawn through "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"undirectedView"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Dense: Householder tridiagonalization and the implicit QL iteration, O(n³) time and n²"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Double"},{"type":"text","text":"s, for graphs of up to a few thousand vertices."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Koren, “Drawing graphs by eigenvectors: theory and practice”, Computers & Mathematics with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Applications 49(11–12), 2005."}]}]}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Precondition","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Every weight is finite and not negative; "},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", when given, is at"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"least 1."}]}]},{"style":"note","type":"aside","name":"Throws","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":""},{"code":"NoConvergence","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" after "},{"code":"maxIterations","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" QL iterations in all (30 n when nil), with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"that count and the off-diagonal entry being reduced, relative to the largest entry of its"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"block. The iteration converges cubically, about two iterations per eigenvalue."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"relatedModules":["GraphProtocols"],"name":"GraphDrawing"}],"title":"spectralLayout(weight:maxIterations:)","extendedModule":"GraphProtocols","roleHeading":"Instance Method","externalID":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P0A7DrawingE14spectralLayout6weight13maxIterationsAD0C0Vy6VertexQzGSd5Edges_5IndexQZXE_SiSgtAA13NoConvergenceVYKF","symbolKind":"method","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spectralLayout"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"weight"},{"kind":"text","text":": ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P5EdgesQa","text":"Edges"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sl5IndexQa","text":"Index"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sd","text":"Double"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"maxIterations"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int"},{"kind":"text","text":"?) "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols13NoConvergenceV","text":"NoConvergence"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:12GraphDrawing0B0V","text":"Drawing"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:14GraphProtocols0A0P6VertexQa","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":">"}],"remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Grafluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/GraphDrawing\/SpectralLayout.swift#L30","fileName":"SpectralLayout.swift"}},"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A drawing whose axes are eigenvectors of the Laplacian: x is the eigenvector of the second"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"smallest eigenvalue of L = D − A (the Fiedler vector of a connected graph) and y that of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the third, both of unit length, in "},{"code":"vertices","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" order."}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/graphdrawing\/graphprotocols\/graph\/spectrallayout(weight:maxiterations:)"]}],"references":{"doc://GraphProtocols/documentation/GraphProtocols/Graph/Vertex":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/GraphProtocols\/documentation\/GraphProtocols\/Graph\/Vertex","title":"Vertex","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"associatedtype"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Vertex"},{"kind":"text","text":" : "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:SH","text":"Hashable"}],"role":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/graphprotocols\/graph\/vertex","kind":"sy